    <string name="dot_description">Shows two small dots over other apps. One switches to Waveei. The other dictates, shows the recording and types what you said into the field in front. To do this, it reads the field you’re in, and a word you correct right after a dictation is added to your vocabulary. It sees which keyboard and app are open, to offer the switch, and then taps the field you were in so the keyboard opens there. With Auto-send on, it finds the app’s Send button by its label and presses it. If an app won’t take typed text, it pastes through the clipboard. Nothing else on your screen is stored or sent.</string>
